# Trivio API examples
#
# Configure the variables for YOUR installation.
# Authenticate before calling protected endpoints.
# Never commit real passwords, JWT tokens or private values.

@baseUrl = http://YOUR_GATEWAY_HOST:YOUR_GATEWAY_PORT
@accessToken = REPLACE_WITH_TOKEN_FROM_LOGIN
@vehicleId = REPLACE_WITH_AVAILABLE_VEHICLE_ID
@orderId = REPLACE_WITH_CREATED_ORDER_ID

### Check first-time OWNER setup status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/setup/status

### Login with an existing account
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"REPLACE_WITH_EMAIL","password":"REPLACE_WITH_PASSWORD"}

### Get vehicles (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vehicles

### Get vehicle details (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}

### Verify logged-in user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create an order for an available vehicle
# Requires a valid JWT.
# Replace vehicleId with an actual available vehicle ID.
# Copy the returned order ID into the orderId variable.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"vehicleId": {{vehicleId}}}

### View my orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Simulate a declined payment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"orderId": {{orderId}}, "approved": false}

### Simulate a successful payment
# Only run when you intend to confirm the purchase.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"orderId": {{orderId}}, "approved": true}

### View order details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### View payment attempts for an order
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/order/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
